t execution</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat\">\n              <div class=\"stat-num\">3</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-label\">pilot sites to establish real deployment workflows</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat\">\n              <div class=\"stat-num\">18–20</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-label\">months of runway to build, deploy, and validate</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hero-note\">\n            Financing objective: reach proof of repeatable deployment with measured spend, not open-ended company building.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"milestones\">\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"milestone-title-row\">\n              <div class=\"milestone-title\">Build</div>\n              <div class=\"milestone-chip\">FOUNDATION</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"milestone-desc\">\n              Complete the implementation-ready product and operating layer required to support live pilot execution in clinical environments.\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"milestone-points\">\n              <div class=\"point\"><div class=\"dot\"></div><span>Hire core product and deployment capacity</span></div>\n              <div class=\"point\"><div class=\"dot\"></div><span>Finish pilot-ready workflows, reporting, and implementation support</span></div>\n              <div class=\"point\"><div class=\"dot\"></div><span>Stand up the playbook required to onboard initial sites efficiently</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"milestone-title-row\">\n              <div class=\"milestone-title\">Deploy</div>\n              <div class=\"milestone-chip\">PILOTS</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"milestone-desc\">\n              Launch 3 pilot sites and demonstrate that Designer can be implemented cleanly inside the visit, not just shown in a demo.\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"milestone-points\">\n              <div class=\"point\"><div class=\"dot\"></div><span>Go live with early partner sites and train frontline users</span></div>\n              <div class=\"point\"><div class=\"dot\"></div><span>Instrument onboarding, usage, and workflow adoption from day one</span></div>\n              <div class=\"point\"><div class=\"dot\"></div><span>Refine deployment steps into a repeatable site-launch motion</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"milestone-title-row\">\n              <div class=\"milestone-title\">Validate</div>\n              <div class=\"milestone-chip\">PROOF</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"milestone-desc\">\n              Generate the evidence needed to support repeatable deployment: operational fit, measurable value, and credible early commercial readiness.\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"milestone-points\">\n              <div class=\"point\"><div class=\"dot\"></div><span>Show engagement and workflow persistence across pilot sites</span></div>\n              <div class=\"point\"><div class=\"dot\"></div><span>Document pilot outcomes and site-level value signals</span></div>\n              <div class=\"point\"><div class=\"dot\"></div><span>Exit the round with a clear deployment case for the next financing step</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"ribbon\" aria-label=\"Use of funds summary\">\n          <div class=\"ribbon-label\">\n            <div class=\"small\">USE OF FUNDS</div>\n            <div class=\"big\">Kept secondary to the milestones</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fund\">\n            <div class=\"fund-top\">\n              <div class=\"fund-pct\">38%</div>\n              <div class=\"fund-name\">Product + engineering</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fund-copy\">Pilot-ready product completion, implementation tooling, and technical delivery support.</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fund\">\n            <div class=\"fund-top\">\n              <div class=\"fund-pct\">27%</div>\n              <div class=\"fund-name\">Deployment + clinical ops</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fund-copy\">Site onboarding, workflow design, training, and day-to-day pilot execution capacity.</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fund\">\n            <div class=\"fund-top\">\n              <div class=\"fund-pct\">18%</div>\n              <div class=\"fund-name\">Validation + analytics</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fund-copy\">Instrumentation, reporting, pilot measurement, and evidence generation for the next step.</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fund\">\n            <div class=\"fund-top\">\n              <div class=\"fund-pct\">17%</div>\n              <div class=\"fund-name\">G&amp;A + contingency</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fund-copy\">Lean overhead, compliance, and buffer to complete the proof-stage plan with discipline.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"footer-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <img\n        class=\"footer-logo\"\n        src=\"../../../../assets/logo/designer-health-logo-black.svg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n      />\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>"
